{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o069a","title":"桓范矫诏出平昌门奔曹爽","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o069a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"桓范矫诏出平昌门奔曹爽","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o069a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p041d-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"司马懿欲召桓范桓范从子言矫诏迫司蕃开门南奔","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p041d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0030","role":"矫诏出奔","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o069a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"召人","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p041d-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0087","role":"开门","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p041d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":249,"label":"正始十年正月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y249","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o066","basis":"正始十年正月"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o069a-q","xiahoucao-q-o066","xiahoucao-q-b-46588bc9fdcd4116f089"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o069a-q","source_order":[9,346,"O069a"],"order":2274}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0030","name":"桓范","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0087","name":"司蕃","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o069a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-75b7c83ac76cada6ce82","layer":"original","quote":"大司农沛国桓范闻兵起，不应太后召〖1〗；矫诏开平昌门〖2〗；拔取剑戟，略将门候〖3〗；南奔爽。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p041d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e208aef32668918e941e","layer":"pei","quote":"范于沛郡，仕次在曹真后。于时曹爽辅政，以范乡里老宿，于九卿中特敬之；然不甚亲也。及宣王起兵，闭城门；以范为晓事，乃指召之，欲使领中领军。范欲应召，而其子谏之；以为车驾在外，不如南出。范疑有顷，儿又促之。范欲去，而司农丞吏，皆止范。范不从，乃突出至平昌城门，城门已闭。门候司蕃，故范举吏也；范呼之，举手中版以示之，矫曰：‘有诏召我，卿促开门！’蕃欲求见诏书，范呵之，言：‘卿非我故吏邪，何以敢尔？’乃开之。范出城，顾谓蕃曰：‘太傅图逆，卿从我去！’蕃徒行不能及，遂避侧。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":447,"end":681},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-46588bc9fdcd4116f089","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-46588bc9fdcd4116f089","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十年：正始十年（公元 249）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5be1013409cc3f861402","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o066","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-a06b19e7658aef13c99d","layer":"original","quote":"十年正月〖1〗，车驾朝高平陵〖2〗。爽兄弟皆从。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
